+| text | `--white` `#ffffff`, `600 .75rem/1 var(--hm-font-ui)`, the words exactly `Ask AI` |
+| contrast | white on `#0e78af` = 4.86:1 (AA text); on `#0a6086` = 6.93:1 |
+| shadow | `0 10px 22px -12px rgba(43, 46, 53, .55)` |
+| animation | `hm-ask-tag-breathe 2600ms ease-in-out infinite`: `scale` 1 → 1.08 → 1, `transform-origin: 50% 100%`. It animates the `scale` property only, so the centring `translate` is never overwritten |
+| paused | while the button is `:hover` or `:focus-visible` (`animation-play-state: paused`) |
+| reduced motion | `animation: none; scale: none` |
+| open window | label hidden while the button has `aria-expanded="true"` |
+| print | hidden |
+| click | `pointer-events: auto`, so a click on the label reaches the button and opens the assistant |
+
+Tokens: `--hm-sky`, `--hm-sky-strong` and `--hm-sky-soft` are owned by
+`hilalmarkets-brand.css`. The public pages never load that sheet, so
+`hilalmarkets.css` carries an identical copy for them.
+`tests/unit/test_invariant_ask_ai_corner_tag.py` fails if the two copies differ.
+
+Neighbours:
+- **Back to top** (`.hm-to-top`, public pages) sits in the same column **above** the
+  label, never overlapping it: `bottom: 128px` (desktop) / `120px` (≤ 640px). The
+  arithmetic is 22 + 56 + 10 + 29 (label at peak scale) + 11 of air.
+- On the dashboard the travelling tag above the orb gets room for the label
+  (`hm-hilal-chat.css`).
+
+Screenshot acceptance, per family, at V1, V2 and V3, plus one with reduced motion:
+- the label is visible, above the circle and centred on it;
+- it is a rounded rectangle, not a pill;
+- it is sky blue with white text reading `Ask AI`;
+- it does not overlap back-to-top or anything else in the corner.
+
